 Java -> JS -> C++
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- GeckoSession.ResponseDelegate gains getUriFilters(); setResponseDelegate
  dispatches 'GeckoView:ResponseFilters' so the session's filter prefixes
  reach Gecko.
- GeckoViewNavigation.sys.mjs listens for that event and forwards it to
  the C++ FilterPushObserver via
  Services.obs.notifyObservers(eventDispatcher, 'sinytra-response-filters',
  filters.join('\n')).

KNOWN GAP (STATUS 1h): the C++ observer logs 'filter observer registered'
but never 'FilterPushObserver topic=...' — the dispatch does not arrive.
Suspects: dispatch before session.open() dropped, JS onEvent not firing,
nsIGeckoViewEventDispatcher QI failure, handler-module routing.
---
